WEBVTT

00:04:56.288 --> 00:05:00.829
my Black and Brown friends
organize public protest and boycotts.

00:05:00.871 --> 00:05:04.538
A lot of my liberal white friends were
marching on the Capitol every weekend.

00:05:04.579 --> 00:05:06.663
And I wanted to write a comic book.

00:05:09.788 --> 00:05:11.163
Was I being silly?

00:05:12.121 --> 00:05:13.371
Vain?

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:16.871
I never made a living off of art before

00:05:16.913 --> 00:05:18.829
and now I just quit my job

00:05:18.871 --> 00:05:21.163
when it seemed like the world
was falling apart.

00:05:22.246 --> 00:05:23.496
Art is silly, right?

00:05:24.329 --> 00:05:25.996
I struggled with this for a while.

00:05:26.038 --> 00:05:30.204
So I took a month to travel
in the UK for the first time.